
Pwogram jesyon-memwa: 1.
Pwogram memwa: 16000000.
>> tokens := ['{}↲.:,x() '].
{ :i
	>> kòd := [''].
	>> x := Nimewo ant: 1 ak: 10.
	{
		>> y := Nimewo ant: 1 ak: (tokens longè).
		kòd ajoute-nan-fen: (tokens karaktè: y).
	} × x.
	{ Fonksyon nouvo: kòd. } trape: { ['Empty']. }, lanse.

} × 10000.
Sòti ekri: ['OK'], nouvo-liy.
